pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"><br />\n</span> \n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"><span>一、开标情况</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"></span></b>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>根据招标文件及招标公告规定，本项目于</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2026</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>年</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>7</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>月</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>日</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>09</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>:</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>00</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>，在惠州市公共资源交易中心召开了开标会议，与会人员有惠州市市政园林事务中心的</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>代表</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、广东联城工程咨询有限公司的相关工作人员、惠州市公共资源交易中心工作人员在监控室同步进行电子见证。截至</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2026</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>年</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>7</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>月</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>日</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>09</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>:</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>00</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>，在规定的时间内提交了电子投标文件投标单位有</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>5</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>家，分别是：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东中煤江南工程勘测设计有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东有色工程勘察设计院</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>核工业赣州工程勘察设计集团有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东省粤东地质工程勘察有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东省惠勘建设工程有限责任公司</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"><span>二、评标情况</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"></span></b>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（一）评标时间：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2026</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>年</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>7</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>月</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>2</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>日</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>10</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>:</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>00</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（二）评标地点：惠州市公共资源交易中心</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>9</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>号评标室</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（三）评标委员会的组成：评标委员会由</span><span>5人组成，分别是1位招标人评委代表以及4位从广东省综合评标评审专家库中随机抽取的评标专家。评标委员会的组成成员名单如下：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>评标</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家一</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家二</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家三</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家四</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>；</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span></u>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>招标人评委代表：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家五</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>；</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>经评标委员会成员在建设工程招标投标电子交易系统投票推荐，推荐</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>专家三</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>为评标委员会组长。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（四）评标办法：定量评审，详见招标文件第三章评标办法。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（五）参与评标环节的投标单位有</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>5</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>家，分别是：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东中煤江南工程勘测设计有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东有色工程勘察设计院</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>核工业赣州工程勘察设计集团有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东省粤东地质工程勘察有限公司</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、</span></span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>广东省惠勘建设工程有限责任公司</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（六）初步评审：评标委员会根据招标文件的评标办法对各投标文件进行初步评审。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>、特征码检查：按照《关于建设工程项目全面启用投标文件特征码检测功能的通知》（</span><span>惠公易函〔</span><span>2020〕78号</span><span>）要求，评标委员</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>会借助惠州市公共资源交易中心建设工程招标投标电子交易系统对所有投标单位的投标文件进行特征码检</span><span>查</span><span>；</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>5</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>家投标单位通过特征码检查。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>2、初步评审不通过情况：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>无</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>3、初步评审结果：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>5</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>家投标单位通过初步评审。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（七）详细评审：评标委员会依据招标文件的评标办法，各自独立根据评标办法规定的量化因素和分值对通过初步评审的各投标单位的投标文件进行打分，并计算出综合得分。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（八）否决投标情况说明：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>无</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>（九）澄清、说明、补正事项纪要：</span></span><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;text-decoration:underline;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>无</span></span></u><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"><span>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"><span>三、评标结果</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;line-height:150%;\"></span></b>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:24.1pt;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>本着</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>“</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>公平、公正、科学、择优</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>”</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>的原则，评标委员会对满足招标文件实质性要求的投标文件，按照招标文件规定的评分标准进行打分，经过严格细致的评审和评比，各投标人综合得分</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>及排名</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"><span>如下：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;color:#000000;line-height:150%;\"></span>\n</p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n\t<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\" bordercolor=\"#000000\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"47\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#000000;\"><span>序号</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#000000;\"></span></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"middle\" width=\"282\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#000000;\"><span>投标人名称</span></span></b>